# tests.list -- the positive tests `make test` builds and boots under QEMU.
# Read by tests/run_tests.sh and by the Makefile (which builds each dir).
# Edit by hand. One row per test, TAB-separated, six fields:
#
#   name     the executable name AND the <name> in the "TEST <name>: PASS" line
#   dir      directory under rts-spikes/ holding the application
#   serial   0..4: which QEMU serial port (MMUART0 .. MMUART4) the verdict is on. A `pass`
#            test must also leave every OTHER port silent (run_tests.sh).
#   expect   pass | xfail
#   observe  xfail only: a grep -E regexp that MUST match QEMU's `-d int,guest_errors`
#            trace or either serial port -- the signature of the documented failure.
#            "-" for a pass row.
#   why      xfail only: the documented defect, one line. "-" for a pass row.
#
# `xfail` is not a skip. The test is still built and booted, and it fails the
# build if it passes (the defect is fixed -- flip the row) or fails in any way
# other than `observe` describes (a different failure is a regression, not a
# known defect). See the comment at the top of run_tests.sh.
#
# These applications are deliberately NOT in the Makefile's APPS: they are not in
# verify's application set, so they never enter metrics.golden.
name	dir	serial	expect	observe	why
textio_test	tests/textio_test	0	pass	-	-
tasking_test	tests/tasking_test	0	xfail	epc:0x[0-9a-f]+, tval:0x0*c002080, desc=fault_store	PLIC_INIT: System.BB.RISCV_PLIC.Initialize clears the enable block with 64-bit stores (memset); QEMU's PLIC faults on non-32-bit accesses, so every tasking image traps at Initialize_Board before main (RTS-PRODUCTION.md A4)
protected_test	tests/protected_test	0	xfail	epc:0x[0-9a-f]+, tval:0x0*c002080, desc=fault_store	PLIC_INIT: same defect as tasking_test -- the image never reaches main
exceptions_test	tests/exceptions_test	0	xfail	epc:0x[0-9a-f]+, tval:0x0*c002080, desc=fault_store	PLIC_INIT: same defect as tasking_test (and behind it, EH_FRAME_HDR: the unwinder finds no .eh_frame_hdr, see RTS-PRODUCTION.md A4)
console_test	tests/console_test	1	pass	-	-
console_mmuart2_test	tests/console_mmuart2_test	2	pass	-	-
console_mmuart3_test	tests/console_mmuart3_test	3	pass	-	-
console_mmuart4_test	tests/console_mmuart4_test	4	pass	-	-
